# #EXP-2024: the pinned live view of an agent's space on this machine (f5-f6-design.md section 6 on
# #EXP-1514). A press on a row of the taskbar's Agent spaces list pins its session's view (ONE at a
# time, by session: it follows a session whose space is made anew): this on-demand top layer at the
# bottom right of the first display, above the taskbar, that never takes the keyboard (no `keyboard`
# key: none) when it maps, is pressed, resized or closed. The header: the session's title (`Agent
# space n` without one), the size button (only where twice the size fits: ede_space {session, size:
# large | default}) and Close (ede_space {session: null}); under it the space as the shell's capture
# loop pictures it (/spaceView/picture, at the display's scale; Image's fallback after 5 s of failed
# captures). The shell sizes the layer from packages/uicore/fixtures/spaces.json (640 or a third of
# the display wide, the space's aspect). View only: a click reaches the view's buttons, never the
# space; it shows no pointer; it covers its corner and takes its clicks until it is closed; captures
# of the person's screen show it black.
surface("space-view", extensions={ede: {layer: "top", anchor: ["bottom", "right"], size: {width: 642, height: 442}, margin: {right: 10, bottom: 10}, onDemand: true, functions: ["ede_space"]}})
$/spaceView/canGrow = false
$/spaceView/large = false
$/spaceView/open = false
$/spaceView/picture = ""
$/spaceView/session = null
$/spaceView/title = ""
root = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", backgroundColor: "$color.popover", borderWidth: 1, borderColor: "$color.border", borderRadius: "$radius.lg", overflow: "hidden"}, children=[space_view_head, space_view_picture])
space_view_head = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", style={height: 40, paddingLeft: "$spacing.sm", paddingRight: "$spacing.xs", flexShrink: 0}, children=[space_view_title, space_view_size, space_view_close])
space_view_title = Text(text=$/spaceView/title, lines=1, style={flexGrow: 1, minWidth: 0})
space_view_size = Button(label=cond(if=$/spaceView/large, then="Smaller", else="Larger"), icon=cond(if=$/spaceView/large, then="ui-fullscreen-exit", else="ui-fullscreen"), variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_space(session=$/spaceView/session, size=cond(if=$/spaceView/large, then="default", else="large"))}, visible=cond(if=$/spaceView/canGrow, then=true, else=false))
space_view_close = Button(label="Close", icon="ui-close", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_space()})
space_view_picture = Image(src=$/spaceView/picture, alt=$/spaceView/title, fit="contain", fallback="nav-computer", style={flexGrow: 1, flexShrink: 1, flexBasis: 0, minHeight: 0, width: "100%"})
